# Smart City Command Centre - Automated Tasks

# Collect department logs and monitor system resources every 5 minutes
*/5 * * * * /home/girish/smart-city-command-centre/bin/Logging\ \&\ Monitoring.sh >> /home/girish/smart-city-command-centre/logs/cron_execution.log 2>&1

# Create archival and backup files daily at 2:00 AM
0 2 * * * /home/girish/smart-city-command-centre/bin/Archival\ \&\ Backup.sh >> /home/girish/smart-city-command-centre/logs/cron_execution.log 2>&1
